<title>FRANCE: Pilots end strike at BA French unit TAT.</title>
<headline>Pilots end strike at BA French unit TAT.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pilots at British Airways Plc's French associate airline, TAT, ended their strike on Friday afternoon, the national pilots union SNPL said.</p>
<p>&quot;The TAT management and the unions SNPL and SNPNAC agreed today to continue talks about working conditions next week. The unions also decided to end their strike,&quot; the union said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5542</p>
</text>
